// Explicit coverage map: official case id → Flutter builder. Every
// non-skipped, non-pending case in sharedCases.json that is not in
// [parityCases] counts as NOT COVERED in the parity percentage; cases listed
// in [parityUncovered] carry the reason, everything else defaults to
// "harnessTodo".
//
// Nothing is registered here. case_map.g.dart (git-ignored; generated by
// tool/parity_case_map.py, run by tool/flutter, tool/parity and
// tool/parity-ext/run) merges every public top-level
// `final Map<String, ParityCase> ...` / `Map<String, ParityUncovered> ...`
// declared in cases/**/*.dart. To add a case family, declare such a map in
// your own cases file; to carry reasons for unmapped ids, declare a
// `Map<String, ParityUncovered>`.
export 'case_map.g.dart';
